{"seq":1,"slug":"build-time-optimization","title":"构建时间优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/large-scale-practices/build-time-optimization","wordCount":822,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"构建时间优化\">构建时间优化</h1><p>大型 iOS 项目的构建时间是影响开发效率的关键因素。本文介绍模块并行编译、显式模块构建、构建缓存以及 Xcode 构建设置优化策略。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>构建时间优化要先看清<strong>时间花在哪儿</strong>，再从几个方向压缩：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>构建时间的组成</strong>：依赖解析、编译、链接等各阶段分别耗时</li>\n<li><strong>模块并行编译</strong>：让无依赖关系的模块同时编译</li>\n<li><strong>显式模块构建</strong>：通过显式模块减少重复的语义分析</li>\n<li><strong>构建缓存策略</strong>：本地缓存与远程缓存命中时跳过重编译</li>\n<li><strong>Build Settings 调优</strong>：用编译器与链接器选项降低单次开销</li>\n</ul>\n<p>其中<strong>组成分析</strong>是前提：不做诊断就直接调设置，往往优化了不占时间的环节。模块化带来的并行编译与缓存，通常是收益最大的方向。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"构建时间的组成\">构建时间的组成</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    Total[&quot;总构建时间&quot;] --&gt; Dep[&quot;依赖解析&quot;]&#10;    Total --&gt; Compile[&quot;编译&quot;]&#10;    Total --&gt; Link[&quot;链接&quot;]&#10;    Total --&gt; CodeSign[&quot;签名&quot;]&#10;    Total --&gt; Copy[&quot;资源拷贝&quot;]&#10;&#10;    Compile --&gt; Serial[&quot;串行编译(瓶颈)&quot;]&#10;    Compile --&gt; Parallel[&quot;并行编译(目标)&quot;]&#10;&#10;    classDef total fill:none,stroke:#F44336&#10;    classDef phase fill:none,stroke:#2196F3&#10;    classDef opt fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50&#10;&#10;    class Total total&#10;    class Dep,Compile,Link,CodeSign,Copy phase&#10;    class Serial,Parallel opt\">graph LR\n    Total[\"总构建时间\"] --&gt; Dep[\"依赖解析\"]\n    Total --&gt; Compile[\"编译\"]\n    Total --&gt; Link[\"链接\"]\n    Total --&gt; CodeSign[\"签名\"]\n    Total --&gt; Copy[\"资源拷贝\"]\n\n    Compile --&gt; Serial[\"串行编译(瓶颈)\"]\n    Compile --&gt; Parallel[\"并行编译(目标)\"]\n\n    classDef total fill:none,stroke:#F44336\n    classDef phase fill:none,stroke:#2196F3\n    classDef opt fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50\n\n    class Total total\n    class Dep,Compile,Link,CodeSign,Copy phase\n    class Serial,Parallel opt</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>典型耗时占比</th>\n<th>优化空间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>依赖解析</td>\n<td>5-10%</td>\n<td>SPM 缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编译</td>\n<td>60-80%</td>\n<td>并行化 + 增量编译</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>链接</td>\n<td>10-15%</td>\n<td>动态库 → 静态库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>签名/资源</td>\n<td>5-10%</td>\n<td>增量签名</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"模块并行编译\">模块并行编译</h2><p>模块化的最大构建收益是并行编译。没有依赖关系的模块可以同时编译：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"gantt\" data-source=\"gantt&#10;    title 模块并行编译时间线&#10;    dateFormat X&#10;    axisFormat %s&#10;&#10;    section 串行编译&#10;    SharedModels: s1, 0, 2&#10;    CoreNetworking: s2, 2, 5&#10;    SharedUI: s3, 5, 7&#10;    FeatureHome: s4, 7, 10&#10;    FeatureProfile: s5, 10, 13&#10;    App: s6, 13, 14&#10;&#10;    section 并行编译&#10;    SharedModels: p1, 0, 2&#10;    CoreNetworking: p2, 2, 5&#10;    SharedUI: p3, 2, 4&#10;    FeatureHome: p4, 5, 8&#10;    FeatureProfile: p5, 5, 8&#10;    App: p6, 8, 9\">gantt\n    title 模块并行编译时间线\n    dateFormat X\n    axisFormat %s\n\n    section 串行编译\n    SharedModels: s1, 0, 2\n    CoreNetworking: s2, 2, 5\n    SharedUI: s3, 5, 7\n    FeatureHome: s4, 7, 10\n    FeatureProfile: s5, 10, 13\n    App: s6, 13, 14\n\n    section 并行编译\n    SharedModels: p1, 0, 2\n    CoreNetworking: p2, 2, 5\n    SharedUI: p3, 2, 4\n    FeatureHome: p4, 5, 8\n    FeatureProfile: p5, 5, 8\n    App: p6, 8, 9</pre><p>最大化并行度的关键原则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// ✅ 浅层依赖 — 最大化并行&#10;// FeatureHome 只依赖 CoreNetworking 和 SharedUI&#10;// FeatureProfile 只依赖 CoreNetworking 和 SharedUI&#10;// 两者可以并行编译&#10;&#10;// ❌ 深层依赖链 — 严重限制并行&#10;// FeatureHome → FeatureUtils → CoreHelpers → Foundation&#10;// 每层必须等待上层编译完成\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 浅层依赖 — 最大化并行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// FeatureHome 只依赖 CoreNetworking 和 SharedUI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// FeatureProfile 只依赖 CoreNetworking 和 SharedUI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 两者可以并行编译</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 深层依赖链 — 严重限制并行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// FeatureHome → FeatureUtils → CoreHelpers → Foundation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 每层必须等待上层编译完成</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 <code>xcodebuild -buildTimingSummary</code> 可以查看每个 target 的编译时间和并行度。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"显式模块构建\">显式模块构建</h2><p>Swift 5.9+ 引入显式模块构建（Explicit Module Builds），通过显式管理模块依赖图来提升编译性能：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// 在 Build Settings 中启用&#10;// SWIFT_ENABLE_EXPLICIT_MODULES = YES&#10;// 或在 Package.swift 中&#10;let package = Package(&#10;    name: &quot;MyModule&quot;,&#10;    platforms: [.iOS(.v17)],&#10;    products: [&#10;        .library(name: &quot;MyModule&quot;, targets: [&quot;MyModule&quot;])&#10;    ],&#10;    targets: [&#10;        .target(&#10;            name: &quot;MyModule&quot;,&#10;            swiftSettings: [&#10;                .enableExperimentalFeature(&quot;ExplicitModules&quot;)&#10;            ]&#10;        )&#10;    ]&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 在 Build Settings 中启用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// SWIFT_ENABLE_EXPLICIT_MODULES = YES</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 或在 Package.swift 中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> package</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Package</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MyModule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    platforms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">iOS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.v17)],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    products</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">library</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MyModule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">targets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MyModule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    targets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MyModule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            swiftSettings</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">enableExperimentalFeature</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ExplicitModules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>隐式模块</th>\n<th>显式模块</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>模块依赖发现</td>\n<td>编译时自动发现</td>\n<td>构建系统预计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存粒度</td>\n<td>文件级</td>\n<td>模块级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行度</td>\n<td>受隐式依赖限制</td>\n<td>最大化并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增量编译效率</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"构建缓存策略\">构建缓存策略</h2><h3 id=\"xcode-本地缓存\">Xcode 本地缓存</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// 确保 Derived Data 缓存生效&#10;// Build Settings:&#10;// BUILD_LIBRARY_FOR_DISTRIBUTION = YES  (用于二进制分发的模块)&#10;// COMPILATION_MODE = wholemodule         (Release)&#10;// COMPILATION_MODE = incremental         (Debug)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 确保 Derived Data 缓存生效</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Build Settings:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// BUILD_LIBRARY_FOR_DISTRIBUTION = YES  (用于二进制分发的模块)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// COMPILATION_MODE = wholemodule         (Release)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// COMPILATION_MODE = incremental         (Debug)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"远程构建缓存\">远程构建缓存</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    Dev[&quot;本地构建&quot;] --&gt;|Hash 匹配?| Check{&quot;缓存命中?&quot;}&#10;    Check --&gt;|是| Download[&quot;下载预编译产物&quot;]&#10;    Check --&gt;|否| Build[&quot;本地编译&quot;]&#10;    Build --&gt; Upload[&quot;上传编译结果&quot;]&#10;    Upload --&gt; Remote[&quot;远程缓存服务&quot;]&#10;    Download --&gt; Remote&#10;&#10;    classDef decision fill:none,stroke:#FF9800&#10;    classDef action fill:none,stroke:#2196F3&#10;    classDef cache fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50&#10;&#10;    class Check decision&#10;    class Dev,Build,Download,Upload action&#10;    class Remote cache\">graph LR\n    Dev[\"本地构建\"] --&gt;|Hash 匹配?| Check{\"缓存命中?\"}\n    Check --&gt;|是| Download[\"下载预编译产物\"]\n    Check --&gt;|否| Build[\"本地编译\"]\n    Build --&gt; Upload[\"上传编译结果\"]\n    Upload --&gt; Remote[\"远程缓存服务\"]\n    Download --&gt; Remote\n\n    classDef decision fill:none,stroke:#FF9800\n    classDef action fill:none,stroke:#2196F3\n    classDef cache fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50\n\n    class Check decision\n    class Dev,Build,Download,Upload action\n    class Remote cache</pre><h3 id=\"tuist-远程缓存\">Tuist 远程缓存</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// tuist cache — 将模块的编译产物上传到远程&#10;// tuist generate — 生成项目时自动使用缓存的 XCFramework&#10;// 未修改的模块直接使用预编译二进制，跳过编译\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// tuist cache — 将模块的编译产物上传到远程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// tuist generate — 生成项目时自动使用缓存的 XCFramework</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 未修改的模块直接使用预编译二进制，跳过编译</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"xcode-build-settings-优化\">Xcode Build Settings 优化</h2><p>关键构建设置调优：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// Debug 配置优化&#10;// DEBUG_INFORMATION_FORMAT = dwarf (不生成 dSYM)&#10;// SWIFT_OPTIMIZATION_LEVEL = -Onone&#10;// SWIFT_COMPILATION_MODE = incremental&#10;// ENABLE_PREVIEWS = YES (仅需要 Preview 的 target)&#10;&#10;// Release 配置优化&#10;// DEBUG_INFORMATION_FORMAT = dwarf-with-dsym&#10;// SWIFT_OPTIMIZATION_LEVEL = -O&#10;// SWIFT_COMPILATION_MODE = wholemodule&#10;// SWIFT_WHOLE_MODULE_OPTIMIZATION = YES\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Debug 配置优化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// DEBUG_INFORMATION_FORMAT = dwarf (不生成 dSYM)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// SWIFT_OPTIMIZATION_LEVEL = -Onone</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// SWIFT_COMPILATION_MODE = incremental</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ENABLE_PREVIEWS = YES (仅需要 Preview 的 target)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Release 配置优化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// DEBUG_INFORMATION_FORMAT = dwarf-with-dsym</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// SWIFT_OPTIMIZATION_LEVEL = -O</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// SWIFT_COMPILATION_MODE = wholemodule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// SWIFT_WHOLE_MODULE_OPTIMIZATION = YES</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设置</th>\n<th>Debug 推荐</th>\n<th>Release 推荐</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SWIFT_COMPILATION_MODE</td>\n<td>incremental</td>\n<td>wholemodule</td>\n<td>编译模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SWIFT_OPTIMIZATION_LEVEL</td>\n<td>-Onone</td>\n<td>-O</td>\n<td>优化级别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DEBUG_INFORMATION_FORMAT</td>\n<td>dwarf</td>\n<td>dwarf-with-dsym</td>\n<td>调试信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ENABLE_TESTABILITY</td>\n<td>YES</td>\n<td>NO</td>\n<td>测试可见性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"编译耗时诊断\">编译耗时诊断</h2><p>使用编译器标志诊断慢函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// 在 Build Settings 中添加 Other Swift Flags:&#10;// -Xfrontend -warn-long-function-bodies=200&#10;// -Xfrontend -warn-long-expression-type-checking=200&#10;// 单位为毫秒，超过阈值的函数/表达式会产生警告\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 在 Build Settings 中添加 Other Swift Flags:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// -Xfrontend -warn-long-function-bodies=200</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// -Xfrontend -warn-long-expression-type-checking=200</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 单位为毫秒，超过阈值的函数/表达式会产生警告</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常见的编译慢根因：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>复杂类型推断</td>\n<td>长链式调用不加类型标注</td>\n<td>添加显式类型声明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字面量字典/数组</td>\n<td>大型内联字典</td>\n<td>拆分或声明类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>泛型约束爆炸</td>\n<td>多层泛型嵌套</td>\n<td>简化泛型层级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过多 #if 编译条件</td>\n<td>大量条件编译</td>\n<td>提取到独立文件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// ❌ 编译慢 — 类型推断复杂&#10;let result = items&#10;    .filter { $0.isActive &amp;&amp; $0.date &gt; startDate }&#10;    .map { ($0.name, $0.value * multiplier + offset) }&#10;    .sorted { $0.1 &gt; $1.1 }&#10;    .prefix(10)&#10;&#10;// ✅ 编译快 — 显式类型&#10;let filtered: [Item] = items.filter { $0.isActive &amp;&amp; $0.date &gt; startDate }&#10;let mapped: [(String, Double)] = filtered.map { ($0.name, $0.value * multiplier + offset) }&#10;let sorted: [(String, Double)] = mapped.sorted { $0.1 &gt; $1.1 }&#10;let result: [(String, Double)] = Array(sorted.prefix(10))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 编译慢 — 类型推断复杂</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> items</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.isActive </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> $0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> startDate }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.name, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> multiplier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> offset) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sorted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> $1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.1 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">prefix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 编译快 — 显式类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> filtered: [Item] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> items.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.isActive </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> $0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> startDate }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mapped: [(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> filtered.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.name, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> multiplier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> offset) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sorted: [(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mapped.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sorted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> $1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.1 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result: [(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sorted.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">prefix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在 CI 中集成构建时间监控，当增量编译时间超过阈值时自动告警。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>模块并行编译是模块化带来的最直接的构建时间收益</li>\n<li>依赖层级越浅，并行度越高；避免深层依赖链</li>\n<li>显式模块构建通过预计算模块依赖图提升编译效率</li>\n<li>Xcode 构建设置需要区分 Debug 和 Release 配置分别优化</li>\n<li>使用编译器诊断标志找出耗时函数，添加类型标注加速编译</li>\n<li>远程构建缓存可以将团队的冷启动编译时间降低 50% 以上</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"构建时间优化","id":"构建时间优化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"构建时间的组成","id":"构建时间的组成"},{"level":2,"text":"模块并行编译","id":"模块并行编译"},{"level":2,"text":"显式模块构建","id":"显式模块构建"},{"level":2,"text":"构建缓存策略","id":"构建缓存策略"},{"level":3,"text":"Xcode 本地缓存","id":"xcode-本地缓存"},{"level":3,"text":"远程构建缓存","id":"远程构建缓存"},{"level":3,"text":"Tuist 远程缓存","id":"tuist-远程缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"Xcode Build Settings 优化","id":"xcode-build-settings-优化"},{"level":2,"text":"编译耗时诊断","id":"编译耗时诊断"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"SwiftUI 导航架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/navigation-architecture/swiftui-navigation-architecture"},"next":{"title":"代码生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/large-scale-practices/code-generation"}}